<title>UK: German inland gas oil firms, ice curbs delivery.</title>
<headline>German inland gas oil firms, ice curbs delivery.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DLR/DM=1.5465)   DM/100 LTRS     DLRS/100 LTRS   LAST DM</p>
<p> HAMBURG	     39.90/40.20     25.80/25.99     38.30/38.60</p>
<p> BREMEN		39.90/40.20     25.80/25.99     38.30/38.60</p>
<p> DUISBURG	    39.90/40.20     25.80/25.99     38.40/38.70</p>
<p> FRANKFURT	   40.60/40.90     26.25/26.44     39.00/39.40</p>
<p> KARLSRUHE	   40.70/41.00     26.31/26.51     39.20/39.50</p>
<p> INGOLSTADT	  41.50/41.80     26.83/27.02     40.00/40.30</p>
<p>German inland gas oil prices rose on Thursday in reaction to continuing freezing weather. Sales volume was steady but physical delivery was slowed by iced canals. Product moved by rail. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7646</p>
